        rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — Morphological realism / specimen match: 90/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Loads and SHA-256-verifies the postaxial hexadactylous vertebrate autopod AP radiograph (`datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/vertebrate_autopod_digits_specimen.jpg`), segments all 6 skeletal digit rays at x = [49, 184, 265, 343, 420, 509] px across the phalangeal ROI y in [280, 400] and traces their longitudinal phalangeal-metacarpal axes (L398-448), overlays the segmented skeletal axes in Panel E and peak detections in Panel F, and compares normalized inter-digit wavelength regularity (central Digits 2-6 CV = 0.0580) against the nonlinear Turing PDE in Panel H." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
